%!PS-Adobe-3.0
%%BoundingBox: 0 0 320 200
%%Title: Terrace test view
% Status: draft
% fractal_clouds#21: the gallery massif (mountains.ps) seen with a narrow
% lens and the sun behind the camera, so the faces toward us are sunlit and
% a rock bed spans many pixels. A test view for TerraceAmp, not a piece.
% Off/on pair: scripts/render.sh -D TerraceAmp=0 spikes/terraces_view.ps

/Seed where { pop } { /Seed 5 def } ifelse
/AA where { pop } { /AA true def } ifelse
/Pitch where { pop } { /Pitch 4 def } ifelse
/Yaw where { pop } { /Yaw 10 def } ifelse
/HFov where { pop } { /HFov 30 def } ifelse
/SunDir where { pop } { /SunDir [ -0.55 0.45 -0.70 ] def } ifelse    % behind the camera, left
/CloudLo where { pop } { /CloudLo 60 def /CloudHi 88 def } ifelse
/CoverAmp where { pop } { /CoverAmp 0.45 def } ifelse
/HazeDist where { pop } { /HazeDist 400 def } ifelse
/Threshold where { pop } { /Threshold 0.57 def } ifelse
/CamLift where { pop } { /CamLift 0.72 def } ifelse

(lib/fc_landscape.ps) run
320 200 fc-landscape
showpage
